  "description": "Conquer Every Ride with the HovGtrs Ultra Dual Battery Electric Bike\n\nMeet the HovGtrs Ultra – a high-performance moped-style electric bike designed for both power and comfort. With dual removable batteries, you can ride up to 150 miles on a single charge, while the 750W continuous / 1500W peak motor and 90 N·m torque sensor deliver smooth, natural, and responsive power on any terrain. Reach speeds of up to 32 MPH effortlessly, whether climbing hills or cruising city streets.\n\nBuilt to carry more, the HovGtrs Ultra supports up to 450 lbs, making it perfect for daily commutes, weekend adventures, or two-up riding. Its upgraded full suspension system, featuring a front fork and dual-spring rear shocks, ensures every ride is stable and comfortable. Wide 20\" × 4\" tires provide added traction and control on rough terrain.\n\nStay connected with the HovGtrs mobile app, available on iOS and Android, to track speed, battery life, mileage, and more. With advanced safety features including 180mm hydraulic disc brakes, front and rear lights, and turn signals, you can ride confidently day or night.\n\nWhether you're chasing speed, distance, or freedom, the HovGtrs Ultra is engineered to elevate every ride with power, range, and comfort.",
